b949e97","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"在下面","glossesEn":["below, lower down"],"examples":[{"english":"to look at sth from underneath","chinese":"从下面看某物"},{"english":"the apartment underneath","chinese":"下面的那套公寓"},{"english":"to run to the bed and crawl underneath","chinese":"跑过去钻到床下"}]},{"id":"underneath:o:0adae180b1a1","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"从下面","glossesEn":["passing below"]},{"id":"underneath:o:3b82f47418a0","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"在里层","glossesEn":["behind layer"],"examples":[{"english":"to reveal plaster underneath","chinese":"露出里层的灰泥"},{"english":"to wear a fur coat with nothing underneath","chinese":"光身穿裘皮大衣"}]},{"id":"underneath:o:705970ce797a","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"在外表下","glossesEn":["behind appearance"],"registers":["figurative"],"examples":[{"english":"to be shy underneath","chinese":"心底里害羞"},{"english":"to be soft-hearted underneath","chinese":"有一颗仁心"}]},{"id":"underneath:o:dd83ebccc794","label":"n.","definitionZh":"下面","glossesEn":["lower part"],"examples":[{"english":"the underneath of a cup/car/bridge","chinese":"杯底/车底/桥底"},{"english":"the underneath of a drawer","chinese":"抽屉底"}]},{"id":"underneath:o:b0719dc2a95b","label":"n.","definitionZh":"底部","glossesEn":["underside"]}]},"understand":{"senses":[{"id":"understand:o:5fe13d74d6c6","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"懂","glossesEn":["grasp meaning of"],"examples":[{"english":"can you understand French?","chinese":"你懂法语吗？"},{"english":"I don't understand what your are saying","chinese":"我不明白你在说些什么"},{"english":"you must be ready on time; is that understood?","chinese":"你必须按时做好准备，听明白了吗？"}]},{"id":"understand:o:425ecc32980f","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"了解","glossesEn":["know operation of"]},{"id":"understand:o:e6276bd00e52","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"理解","glossesEn":["interpret"]},{"id":"understand:o:b637cb66c6b5","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"意识到","glossesEn":["appreciate"],"examples":[{"english":"they don't understand the danger they are in","chinese":"他们没有意识到自己所处的危险"}]},{"id":"understand:o:84df79fb155d","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"认识到…的原因","glossesEn":["know reason for"],"examples":[{"english":"no one is answering the phone; I can’t understand it","chinese":"没人接电话，我不知道是怎么回事"},{"english":"I could never understand why she was fired","chinese":"我怎么也不明白她为何被解雇"},{"english":"I just can’t understand his taking the money","chinese":"我就是不明白他为什么会偷钱"}]},{"id":"understand:o:b2440e6ece3c","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"体谅","glossesEn":["empathize with"],"examples":[{"english":"I can understand you feeling angry or that you feel angry","chinese":"你生气我能理解"},{"english":"we understand what you're going through","chinese":"我们同情你目前的遭遇"}]},{"id":"understand:o:d14ea8bcaa24","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"认为","glossesEn":["believe"],"examples":[{"english":"I understand you wish to see the manager","chinese":"听说您想见经理"},{"english":"am I to understand that you refuse?","chinese":"你是说你拒绝了？"},{"english":"the Prime Minister is understood to have been extremely angry about the report","chinese":"据说首相对该报道大为恼火"}]},{"id":"understand:o:9037a701ec67","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"得知","glossesEn":["be told"]},{"id":"understand:o:df9501148cd0","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"默认","glossesEn":["agree"],"examples":[{"english":"it must be understood that …","chinese":"…一定不言而喻"},{"english":"I thought it was understood that my expenses would be paid","chinese":"我原以为对方同意支付我的费用"}]},{"id":"understand:o:85b8ca9d3669","label":"vt.","definitionZh":"推断出","glossesEn":["imply"],"domains":["Linguistics"],"examples":[{"english":"in the sentence ‘I can’t drive’, the object ‘a car’ is understood","chinese":"在“I can’t drive”一句中，可推测宾语“a car”被省略了"}]},{"id":"understand:o:3094de2b6813","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"懂得","glossesEn":["comprehend"],"examples":[{"english":"I’m not sure that I understand: go over it again","chinese":"我不敢说我搞懂了，再来一遍吧"},{"english":"no slip-ups! (do you) understand?","chinese":"别出差错！（你）听明白了吗？"}]},{"id":"understand:o:afa94b85c21a","label":"vi.","definitionZh":"体谅","glossesEn":["sympathize"],"examples":[{"english":"I quite understand; it must be very difficult for you","chinese":"我很理解，这对你来说一定很艰难"}]}]}}}